OL,3,GNEWSAPilot unhurt after forced landing
OL,4,Ain field
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pilot of a light aircraft that made
OL,7,Fa forced landing in a field managed to
OL,8,Fescape uninjured, police have said
OL,10,FThe plane came down near the village of
OL,11,FTingewick, in Buckinghamshire, on
OL,12,FMonday evening.
OL,14,FThames Valley Police said the Ikarus
OL,15,FC42 aircraft was "unable to fly"
OL,16,Ffollowing the incident, which it
OL,17,Fdescribed as a "hard landing".
OL,19,FA spokesperson for the Air Accidents
OL,20,FInvestigation Branch said its officials
OL,21,Fhad "begun making inquiries" into what
OL,22,Fhappened.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
